869,"rmse":0.2606,"mape":4.2797,"mae_b0":0.181,"mae_b2":0.2943},{"crop":"palay","model":"B3","reporting_unit":"Davao de Oro","n":59,"mae":0.2614,"rmse":0.3459,"mape":6.4042,"mae_b0":0.3017,"mae_b2":0.2579},{"crop":"palay","model":"B3","reporting_unit":"Davao del Norte","n":59,"mae":0.2093,"rmse":0.2649,"mape":5.0437,"mae_b0":0.2362,"mae_b2":0.2459},{"crop":"palay","model":"B3","reporting_unit":"Davao del Sur","n":14,"mae":0.4361,"rmse":0.4653,"mape":8.7013,"mae_b0":0.4813,"mae_b2":0.391},{"crop":"palay","model":"B3","reporting_unit":"Davao del Sur+Davao City","n":17,"mae":0.2662,"rmse":0.3381,"mape":5.4303,"mae_b0":0.2798,"mae_b2":0.2613},{"crop":"palay","model":"B3","reporting_unit":"Davao del Sur+Davao Occidental","n":28,"mae":0.3976,"rmse":0.4823,"mape":8.5341,"mae_b0":0.4766,"mae_b2":0.403}],"rain_shift":{"mean_all_mm":132.8,"years_all":[1987,2026],"mean_modis_era_mm":197.9,"years_modis_era":[2002,2026]},"caveats":["corn: B3 was added as a candidate after seeing the B0/B2 test-fold results, so its confidence interval vs B2 is optimistic.","palay: B3 was added as a candidate after seeing the B0/B2 test-fold results, so its confidence interval vs B2 is optimistic.","Caveats. B3 and the \"best satellite model\" were chosen after seeing the test-fold results, so their CIs are optimistic. Several comparisons are made per crop (each candidate vs B2 and vs B0) without multiple-comparison correction. The CIs resample only 15 test years.","Deviation from Requirement 6.1. The rule above (MODIS era decides, lowest-MAE qualifying candidate, B3 added as a candidate) replaces the original Requirement 6.1 (the simplest model whose MAE beats B2 with a 95% CI excluding zero, else B2), and it was set after the results were seen. Applied to the same candidate table (`reports/selection.csv`, without the post hoc B3, simplicity order B0 < B1 < B2 < AnomalyRidge < BoostedModel), Requirement 6.1 would select corn → B0, palay → B2; the shipped rule selects corn → B3, palay → B3.","Rainfall anomalies are shifted: recent growing windows average +198 mm vs the 1981-2000 ERA5 climatology, so a positive rainfall anomaly is not unusual by itself.","Predicted production assumes the same harvested area as the same quarter last year; newly regrouped units have no area forecast."],"likely_reasons":["The ESA WorldCover cropland class mixes rice and corn with plantations (coconut, banana and other tree crops), so province-mean NDVI/EVI mostly tracks non-target vegetation.","Mapped cropland is small in places: Davao Occidental 286 ha, Davao City 2,323 ha, Davao Oriental 7,023 ha, Davao de Oro 13,793 ha, Davao del Sur 18,539 ha, Davao del Norte 20,694 ha (WorldCover cropland, `data/interim/rainfall_points.csv`).","Quarterly PSA survey estimates are noisy, and at province-quarter level that noise can swamp a weather or greenness signal.","The Sentinel-2 era has only 6 test years (2021-2026), so its CIs are wide.","BoostedModel has no year input and cannot follow the yield trend that B2 captures."],"limitations":["Reporting-unit regroupings break B0 (no same-unit value last year) and shorten B1/B2 histories, so these rows use crude fallbacks. Rows where B0 fell back to B1 (unit, year: rows): Davao City 2025: 6; Davao City 2026: 2; Davao Occidental 2019: 8; Davao del Sur 2019: 8; Davao del Sur 2025: 6; Davao del Sur 2026: 2; Davao del Sur+Davao City 2021: 8.","2026 covers quarters Q1, Q2, Q3 only, and recent PSA figures are likely provisional.","The cropland mask is a single 2020/21 WorldCover snapshot applied to every year.","Rainfall is ERA5 reanalysis on a ~0.25° (~28 km) grid at one point per province, not gauge-corrected."],"next_steps":["A rice-paddy mask (an existing paddy map, or Sentinel-1/2 phenology-based mapping) so indices average over rice fields only; a separate corn mask.","Sentinel-1 SAR flood/inundation detection for rice transplanting timing and planted area (cloud-independent).","Re-evaluate with more Sentinel-2 years as they accumulate."],"counts":{"prediction_rows":618,"test_years":[2012,2026],"n_test_years":15,"reporting_units":8,"rows_with_interval":498,"b0_fallback_rows":40,"no_area_forecast_rows":24,"outlier_rows":7,"satellite_runs":28},"figures":[{"file":"assets/figures/mae_by_model.png","title":"mae by model"},{"file":"assets/figures/observed_vs_predicted_corn.png","title":"observed vs predicted corn"},{"file":"assets/figures/observed_vs_predicted_palay.png","title":"observed vs predicted palay"},{"file":"assets/figures/residuals_by_year.png","title":"residuals by year"}]}